    "text": "<p>In the circuit shown in the figure, the ratio of the quality factor and the band width is _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/47cab935-f94e-4b92-abe5-712b153d2695-9893873.PNG\" style=\"width: 321px; height: 180px;\" /></p>",
